---
import { siteConfig } from '../data/siteConfig';
---

<section id="valor" class="section fees-section" aria-labelledby="fees-title">
  <p class="eyebrow">Investimento</p>

  <div class="investment-layout">
    <div class="investment-price" aria-label={`${siteConfig.assessment.price} reais pelo pacote completo de avaliação neuropsicológica`}>
      <h2 id="fees-title"><span class="price-currency">R$</span> {siteConfig.assessment.price}</h2>
      <p class="investment-unit">pelo pacote completo</p>
      <p class="investment-duration"><strong>{siteConfig.assessment.sessions}</strong></p>
    </div>

    <div class="investment-details">
      <p><strong>Anamnese, testes, análise, devolutiva e laudo técnico</strong> incluídos.</p>
      <p><strong>Consulta médica opcional</strong>, quando necessária, sem custo adicional.</p>
      <p><strong>Pagamento à vista.</strong></p>
      <p>Parcelamento no cartão <strong>com juros</strong>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <a class="investment-faq" href="#faq">Entenda os detalhes no FAQ</a>
</section>
